WEBVTT

00:07:58.561 --> 00:08:01.081
saj veste, ko bodo šli
na Harvard Business School.

00:08:01.081 --> 00:08:04.310
Poskušamo jih naučiti
odgovornega ravnanja z denarjem

00:08:04.310 --> 00:08:07.767
in biti znanstveno usmerjeni in ekološki

00:08:07.767 --> 00:08:10.733
in brezglutenski,

00:08:10.733 --> 00:08:12.705
čeprav je mogoče zdaj dobro,
da vam povem,

00:08:12.705 --> 00:08:18.245
da sama nisem bila ekološki
in brezglutenski otrok.

00:08:18.245 --> 00:08:23.035
Pojedla sem kupe pireja
iz testenin in govedine.

00:08:23.035 --> 00:08:25.212
In veste kaj? Čisto v redu sem.

00:08:25.212 --> 00:08:27.625
Plačujem davke.

00:08:27.625 --> 00:08:30.842
Imam redno službo.